* If the network is gone, the wiki shows **one** notice ("Connection to the server interrupted …") instead of an alarm on every failed attempt.

* Your unsaved changes are kept.
* The notice disappears by itself once saving works again.
* The retries slow down (5 → 10 → 30 → 60 seconds) so a laptop waking up does not keep asking.
* If the server answers with an error (e.g. 403 or 503), you still get the normal message — only a real outage shows the connection notice.